Exod 34:1 , The tables are renewed;
Exod 34:5 , The name of the LORD proclaimed;
Exod 34:8 , Moses entreats God to go with them;
Exod 34:10 , God makes a covenant with them, repeating certain duties of the first table;
Exod 34:28 , Moses, after forty days in the mount, comes down with the tables;
Exod 34:29 , His face shines, and he covers it with a vail.
